Naming convention

GRECO stands for Geometric Registration of Electron Cryotomography Observations
and names the mathematical algorithm described in this work. Greco is the
software that implements this algorithm and provides the surrounding processing
workflow. Within this software, the Greco optimizer is the component that
performs the registration and geometry optimization. The lowercase name greco
refers to the executable used to launch the software and to the repository name.

